[N 14 Dalaran to Loch Modan]
[D Forever Druid 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Skyborne join leg: off the skycutter in Dalaran to Alfina Nightgaze, the Skyborne Portal to Stormwind, Bolvar and Randal, hearth, bank, Auction House and flight point, Sheldras in the Park, then Teleport: Moonglade and the Cure Poison chain through Moonglade, Auberdine and Darnassus; hearth back, the tram to Ironforge for Mekkatorque and Magni, then Earthseer Farsen's Dark Iron chain on the road through Dun Morogh into Loch Modan.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffDalaran to Loch Modan 14|r  -  8,440 XP of hand-ins on this leg
[OC]|cffffcc00Map note:|r Guidelime has no map for Forever's Dalaran, so the Dalaran steps point at the Alterac Mountains map with the quest database's coordinates (unverified in game) - if the arrow is off, Denaaris stands beside the Skyborne Portal where the skycutter lands, and Alfina Nightgaze a few steps from her

[OC]|cffffffffDalaran|r  -  1 hand-in, 90 XP; the skycutter lands by the Kirin Tor camp on the lake shore west of the city
At [TAR259084 Denaaris Stargale] beside the Skyborne Portal, [QT94946 The Magical City of Dalaran] [QA94947 Welcome to Azeroth] [G12.3,56.3 Alterac Mountains]
[A Druid] At [TAR270459 Alfina Nightgaze] (druid trainer) by the landing, [QA94912 Child of Nature] [QA6121 Lessons Anew] and [T] train every new rank (Bash at 14) [G11.8,56.6 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Lessons Anew|r needs level 14. If you landed at 13 she will not offer it: Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus also starts it - the Moonglade step below says how to fit him in
Take the Skyborne Portal to Stormwind right next to Denaaris (beta reports put the landing at the Mage Tower in the Mage Quarter, the south-west corner of the city - unverified) [QC94947] [G12.0,56.2 Alterac Mountains]
[A Druid] In the Mage Quarter at [TAR1313 Maria Lumere] (Alchemy Supplies), [V] buy 5 Earthroot [CI2449,5] for Gathering the Cure - the quest database lists her as a vendor of it (84c each, stock 6 - Wowhead Forever; Antonio Perelli at the Elwynn 78.1,73.0 wagon sells it too, 80c, stock 3) [G55.9,85.6 Stormwind City]

[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r  -  2 hand-ins, 1,520 XP; Stormwind Keep is the north end of the city
In the Keep's throne room at [TAR1748 Highlord Bolvar Fordragon], [QT94947 Welcome to Azeroth] [QA93963 Exploring the Alliance] [QA98021 Journey to Sentinel Hill] [G80.2,38.4 Stormwind City]
[OC]|cffffcc00Exploring the Alliance|r (1,150 XP): speak with Randal Emerson here, Tyrande Whisperwind in Darnassus and Mekkatorque and Magni in Ironforge - all four on this leg; Bolvar takes the quest back on the first Stormwind pass after Loch Modan (Cloak of the Honored Guest: cloak 14 armor +1 Sta +1 AP +1 SP). |cffffcc00Journey to Sentinel Hill|r (455 XP) goes to Gryan Stoutmantle when the route reaches Westfall. Both stay in your log
In the Keep at [TAR275491 Randal Emerson], take his instructions [QC93963,1] [G79,45 Stormwind City]
[OC]Leave the Keep and run south-west through Old Town into the Trade District
At flightmaster [TAR352 Dungar Longdrink] on the gate ramp, get the [P Stormwind] flightpoint [G71.3,72.2 Stormwind City]
[OC]The bank is in the Trade District on the way (the Burnside bankers, about 64,81) - drop off anything you carried from the island
At [TAR6740 Innkeeper Allison] in the Gilded Rose, set your hearthstone here: the Moonglade loop below ends with the hearth back to Stormwind [G60.4,75.3 Stormwind City]
[A Druid] At the Auction House ([TAR15659 Auctioneer Jaxon]), buy 5 Earthroot [CI2449,5] for Gathering the Cure if you did not get them from Maria Lumere (if she was sold out) [G61.1,70.7 Stormwind City]
[OC][A Druid] No Earthroot on the AH? The quest database has it dropping from Lasher Sproutlings (level 6-7) in Teldrassil around 56.7,69.0 (rate unknown - budget ~15 kills): on the first Rut'theran stop take the portal up to Darnassus and run east out of the city to them before you board the boat (unverified)
[OC]Run west along the canal into the Park
[A Druid] At [TAR5504 Sheldras Moontree] (druid trainer) in the Park, [QT94912 Child of Nature] [QA94914 Moonglade] [G35.8,67.4 Stormwind City]
[A Druid] At [TAR5504 Sheldras Moontree], [T] train anything Alfina did not, and Teleport: Moonglade if accepting Moonglade did not teach it (unverified which; the trainer list has it at 10) - you need the spell for the next step [G35.8,67.4 Stormwind City]

[OC]|cffffffffMoonglade, Darkshore and Darnassus|r  -  the Cure Poison chain, 6 hand-ins, 3,510 XP (Moonglade 210 + Lessons Anew 100 + The Principal Source 740 + Gathering the Cure 740 + Curing the Sick 740 + Power over Poison 980). Nothing on this loop binds your hearthstone
[OC][A Druid] Cast Teleport: Moonglade (10 s cast, 120 mana, no cooldown on the tooltip - unverified in game); you arrive at Nighthaven
[A Druid] In Nighthaven at [TAR11802 Dendrite Starblaze], [QT94914 Moonglade] [QT6121 Lessons Anew] [QA6122 The Principal Source] [G56.2,30.6 Moonglade]
[OC][A Druid] Arrived at 13 without Lessons Anew? Fly Silva to Rut'theran as below, take the portal up to Darnassus, take Lessons Anew from Mathrengyl Bearwalker (35.4,8.4) once you are 14, cast Teleport: Moonglade and pick up here. Loganaar (52.5,40.6) is the Moonglade trainer, but druids learn nothing new at 15, so Mathrengyl trains at the end of the loop
[A Druid] At [TAR11800 Silva Fil'naveth], take the free druid flight to Rut'theran Village (one way; druid-only per Classic, unverified on Forever) [G44.2,45.2 Moonglade]
At [TAR3838 Vesprystus] in Rut'theran Village, get the [P Rut'theran Village] flight path [G58.4,94 Teldrassil]
Board the boat to Auberdine at the Rut'theran pier, a short walk from Vesprystus (read the signs; about 5 minutes) [G58.4,94 Teldrassil]
Off the boat in Auberdine, at flight master [TAR3841 Caylais Moonfeather], get the [P Auberdine] flight path [G36.3,45.6 Darkshore]
[OC][A Druid] |cffffcc00Darkshore order:|r each quest is handed to Alanndarian before the next one opens, so it is cave, Auberdine, fungus, Auberdine, deer: the cave is the far point north-east of town, the fungus and the deer both sit 6-10 map units east of Auberdine
[A Druid] Run north-east to Cliffspring Falls; use the Empty Cliffspring Falls Sampler at the Cliffspring Falls Cave Mouth (no need to go in; the DB puts moonkin, level 11-14, in and around the cave - no naga) [QC6122] [G54.9,33.3 Darkshore]
[A Druid] Back in Auberdine at [TAR3702 Alanndarian Nightsong], [QT6122 The Principal Source] [QA6123 Gathering the Cure] [G37.7,40.7 Darkshore]
[A Druid] East of town, loot 12 Lunar Fungus from the Lunar Fungal Blooms (20 spawns between 42,45 and 47,53) [QC6123,2] [G43.8,50.2 Darkshore]
[A Druid] At [TAR3702 Alanndarian Nightsong], [QT6123 Gathering the Cure] [QA6124 Curing the Sick] [G37.7,40.7 Darkshore]
[A Druid] Use the Curative Animal Salve on 10 [TAR12298 Sickly Deer] - they graze all over Darkshore, thickest east and north-east of Auberdine [QC6124] [G45.0,44.3 Darkshore]
[OC][A Druid] Cast Teleport: Moonglade from wherever the last deer was
[A Druid] At [TAR11802 Dendrite Starblaze], [QT6124 Curing the Sick] [QA6125 Power over Poison] [G56.2,30.6 Moonglade]
[OC][A Druid] Curing the Sick rewards the Veildust Medicine Bag (not gear)
[A Druid] At [TAR11800 Silva Fil'naveth], fly to Rut'theran Village again [G44.2,45.2 Moonglade]
[OC]Walk into the portal inside Rut'theran Village: it leads up to Darnassus. Mathrengyl is in the Cenarion Enclave in the north-west of the city
[A Druid] At [TAR4217 Mathrengyl Bearwalker], [QT6125 Power over Poison] - it teaches Cure Poison (Wowhead, Forever) [G35.4,8.4 Darnassus]
[A Druid] At [TAR4217 Mathrengyl Bearwalker], [T] train anything new [G35.4,8.4 Darnassus]
In the Temple of the Moon at the south end of the city, speak with [TAR7999 Tyrande Whisperwind] [QC93963,4] [G39.1,81.6 Darnassus]
Use your hearthstone back to the Gilded Rose in Stormwind [G39.1,81.6 Darnassus]
[OC]From the Gilded Rose run north-east along the canal to the Dwarven District and take the Deeprun Tram (the big building at the back of the district) to Ironforge [G73.1,49.2 Stormwind City]

[OC]|cffffffffIronforge|r  -  the tram arrives at the east end of Tinker Town
In Tinker Town at [TAR7937 High Tinker Mekkatorque], [QC93963,2] [G68.8,49 Ironforge]
In the High Seat at [TAR2784 King Magni Bronzebeard], [QC93963,3] [G39.1,56.2 Ironforge]
In the Great Forge at [TAR1573 Gryth Thurden], get the [P Ironforge] flightpoint [G55.5,47.7 Ironforge]
[OC]|cffffcc00Trainers for later Ironforge passes:|r Journeyman Skinning (Balthus Stoneflayer 39.9,32.5) and Mining (Geofram Bouldertoe 50.0,26.3) in the Great Forge, Cooking (Daryl Riknussun 60.1,36.4), First Aid (Nissa Firestone 55.1,58.3), Fishing (Grimnur Stonebrand 48.1,6.9, Forlorn Cavern) - each needs skill 50, so none of them is a stop yet. There is no druid trainer in Ironforge: yours are in the Stormwind Park, Darnassus and Moonglade

[OC]|cffffffffDun Morogh|r  -  out the front gate and east along the road: Steelgrill's Depot, Amberstill Ranch, then the hill overlooking the Gol'Bolar Quarry on the right (4 hand-ins, 3,320 XP on this road)
At [TAR1376 Beldin Steelgrill] at Steelgrill's Depot beside the road, [QA96408 A Visitor to Dun Morogh] (680 XP, handed to Farsen just ahead) [G50.4,49.1 Dun Morogh]
At [TAR264936 Earthseer Farsen], [QT96408 A Visitor to Dun Morogh] [QA96392 Farsen's Watch] [G64.8,58.4 Dun Morogh]
Talk to [TAR264936 Earthseer Farsen] again and pick the farsight option; move or press Esc to end the vision [QC96392] [G64.8,58.4 Dun Morogh]
At [TAR264936 Earthseer Farsen], [QT96392 Farsen's Watch] [QA96390 Nip 'Em in the Bud] [G64.8,58.4 Dun Morogh]
[OC]Continue east past the quarry to the Dark Iron camp (Ironband's Compound)
Kill 10 [TAR6123 Dark Iron Spy] (level 9-10) and keep killing until a Dark Iron Map drops [QC96390] (8.4% per spy and 12.8% from Captain Beld, Wowhead Forever sample - budget ~15 more spies after the 10, about 9 in 10 odds) [G77,60.5 Dun Morogh]
Use the Dark Iron Map to start [QA96391 Underground Map] [G77,60.5 Dun Morogh]
[OC]Run back west to the quarry hill
At [TAR264936 Earthseer Farsen], [QT96390 Nip 'Em in the Bud] [QT96391 Underground Map] [QA96393 Old Ironforge Incursion] [G64.8,58.4 Dun Morogh]
[OC]|cffffcc00Old Ironforge Incursion|r is the Hall of Thanes dungeon quest (level 16, handed in to Magni) - it sits in your log until the 15-16 chapter.
[OC]Run east along the road past the quarry to the fork, then east through the tunnel to South Gate Outpost, and south through the second tunnel of South Gate Pass into Loch Modan [G86.3,48.8 Dun Morogh]
[OC]|cffffffffFinished: Dalaran to Loch Modan|r  -  continue with 11-15 Loch Modan (you arrive at the bunker just outside the pass)
[OC]|cffffcc00Catch-up:|r nothing on this leg is crowd-tagged. If the Dark Iron Map never dropped, Farsen's camp is on this road and the Dark Iron camp 5 minutes east of it - the Hall of Thanes chapter needs Old Ironforge Incursion
